      "value": "Maybe this is clearer in Japanese, but your post isn't clear on what is illegal about the avatars that you're concerned with. You might be meaning NSFW or booth models.\n\nI did see a post on reddit awhile back from a user that was unhappy that there was a crack down on improperly public avatars. Made me smile. \n\nInstead of deleting world, keep an eye on avatar IDs shared on pedestals when changes are needed ;)",
